    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ccfdc92a2b8be545c4818a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那当然！\n我所崇拜的帝王创下了传说耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "564d3d9de9b5cb45679e5caf5d488ce14ca2f916c7922bf88026241f17e827d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2bf40a4a5f5658a935e0648",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春季庆贺……",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d54e73d3f22c4f29f148a3980f3df8d4e68c37e263df4b92ca2d4c0aa5781b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62d07160e3c9cd10557a5c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与才华洋溢的活泼赛马娘──\n东海帝王展开了热血的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1617ea0590a37e76f7f36aae61b61bb1204ec2fc6b6c9584e0ba1526257dec45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a472bc7e1adf5110099262",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王对学生会长鲁道夫象征\n抱持着强烈的憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "994c277f53aeeb506f3efcb901f6bea22d10a3aca405bbc0da088b32cadc660e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b5089cac7839b4029c7d576",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她奋发向上……\n立志成为超越鲁道夫象征的\n强大赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3c04f019af819c728b5506b8f984bc1b692c1008f75c97ea49627ee367a086d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:075d300b13220b13e59b37be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f580c81b2db672ed0a389e4f4901976a6365c0a93ef2d0ed6f3b831b1a8841",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63820ecc5303bb94b8fbe6f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近年底的某一天，东海帝王为了观看\n鲁道夫象征参赛的“有马纪念”，\n前往了中山赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2fef50d154a04e620c9805cf0484315c999f1a35bc84dc07e6bccd72a4698ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305cac84394ce0fcd8b4935a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征展现出的压倒性实力\n不只让东海帝王感到“崇拜”，\n也让她切身感受到实力的差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dbc6a55c754cbe1e22e4f359a7f3b06e353dbcfbb5dcb5aa49fd7e90191fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b217b40fa9d92059a304a69e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，她想与鲁道夫象征并驾齐驱的\n想法仍然没有改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f6ef0f28118ee1b945a9024668ac3dcaef89d67fe99b7e3bf98d7f829fd232",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d59b805dbe0894a3eb28c73c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "做好踏上艰难之路的觉悟，\n不轻言放弃的东海帝王\n再次下定了决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb6acf30aac324df277e753401765adeb66d00c7645c6f0bbe7c82cfc2b8e9b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f3396c27fb809266d218ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无敌高的目标",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a522219edb5bb09b54218148cd1b4a14bf58079ebcc9a0b15c58e0d68bea232",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf488b1988810b6a9d1db95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这天举行了“皋月赏”的记者会。\n东海帝王在采访中发表宣言，\n说要成为“三冠赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a51c8dfdc3329034413fa810e616f4d9c75d54a0df481bde05dbed9c4b5cad8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998c02d8dda7953107946697",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她的“憧憬”远得难以轻易触及。\n为了追上并超越在遥远的高处\n等着她的鲁道夫象征──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa4215e7f752cb3e4e7967e0b659a3631aa1f0ae42e95f67b0cd0a3d1df2af9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e288bbd641c0009718261297",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王飞奔向前，\n决定比以往更加卖力训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ebafe7a67311168728f827547727ad0cfe87801c72c2837395fcd000e1e1a58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf05d31589f7c72b53ce316",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征暗中守护着东海帝王……\n低声说会等着她追上自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7621423bd4c17daef58e5c006f34eae7c1fbada501f76e5f5e9122375fbfd07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5072d5aac1e270836b6e368",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典赛前记者会",
      "source_fingerprint": "187e4d57ffcc92dcce6a7553053933216dfd183b97b8b6281b9ffb2fffb1720f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929fde2e0013fbf0619d6de8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”隔天。东海帝王为了参加\n据传总是由强大赛马娘胜出的“菊花赏”，\n努力不懈地进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a5d9b043ee5254f3a3b2c898db2c817f7192c113ad8d3b62cf87a7dcd28f73c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806b9f12c6da91bbd8db61a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但一再勉强训练反而伤了脚，\n被宣告这个状态\n恐怕难以参加“菊花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be9bba3d2854e08d5c92a6e5f92fa528c292692240504fa615ead5e77c138b8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e3a2f592b2f8a41ca9f7d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，她展现出即使勉强自己\n都要继续训练，照样参加“菊花赏”的\n坚定意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3aa2451fe53d1cdab9350501abd246f2358330cb4b0691e344a48492019316",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82d1df94ac5ca7c064917868",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员被她的热情打动，\n调查并实施各种治疗方法，\n成功调养好她的脚伤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76c18e36e4aefb76dba64621dc25d894ea62077a67d9d57fcfb6c0ef1e2b946",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1db740191094da596463852d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加菊花赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67ea4b3eacc8d62e6023e08a66e98ae3c07ef64b62fc1e4328f9b4e97c1b6743",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cf1b9fd055293d46c6556f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王正为了下一场竞赛……\n“天皇赏（春）”而日复一日地勤奋训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d7acded0a63541726f6031b1becf5f2ce00a1a8c14200b57445a44476d40ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752c1242600b324d6225fa90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，在“天皇赏（春）”出赛的\n赛马娘集体参加了记者会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e99eeb5efe1084a0c2b8eeb94702b6147c4f4582a212ed22b607de89c166ab4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee4467484966b1bc4c837a70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王自信满满地发表必胜宣言。\n紧接着，目白麦昆也诉说了\n夺胜的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "231a3b1f095c205ab116f4bebbd3bc20d1b25dc45a7c6fdc784b5aabfa07646c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61c054b8c63002e9e277a65b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赌上互不相让的意念，\n东海帝王与目白麦昆在正式比赛前\n激烈交锋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bdf93c5a0df628b9741040e9b8a8a91314113f907e0589bb1b702aad639df9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b03d8ded1eb16f5523fac31a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "地VS天",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0749c8b32861a70a8d9be834ce00f5be524ebd3c83e6b4810546126022172a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63bf9fea18c040d841c641fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每天进行训练前，\n东海帝王都会回顾\n目白麦昆比赛时的视频。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ec43bcf1ee5a9de829cb83675cb86449fa1fa67c6f71b384f4de9dff3cea3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f753c7a9be6d740dbfae66f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她仍然无法理解\n自己为何比不上目白麦昆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c944cb7ab0b20e1318db4f24accf44a9366813e5f71f3c6abcf6d414a00a14c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64db4707e76c52b302ef250",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她所欠缺的东西……\n是谷底翻身的强烈斗志。\n训练员察觉这一点后告诉了她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2599911091d9b3cfe6acc250e26bea04bcc86ac154a10eeb2a1015e27921f417",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b427151a4321ef147d51c02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王起初拒绝面对，\n但继续逃避就不可能变强，\n最终正视了自己的败北。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e7d83878154af7937c6307c6cd7743d1dc2de6407a30c73ff7a7922fa241f6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c49b6e0e3f9c8321b13eafe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王接受自己输给目白麦昆的事实，\n将心中的不甘化为动力，\n有了更进一步的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e101d98594d37e1f3d8ea9104ca0fedf8a71cf8c9777fe3e577a5bb95840122f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4aab02ccb8c410d0a83202",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "克服落败的痛苦",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6fe9bc41c25f9e695317594975f510a44df7e95d981ac3951606ca909a27543",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184945a46c60f89a69f0eb1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天训练后──\n东海帝王看见留下来\n继续练跑的目白麦昆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd3cd3caa7567bb72cf129d86501a7cf5668c53b2352861ad69cd11cea9315ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1214442cfef0eb3b151b8b0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王也不断进行训练，\n不停进步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d8110de9bc35c43bd26c9314092c57663054a142ea5166de782ec84ef50b1ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e0d7d0a421c2dd5f4ddb5c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此，她无法相信\n鲁道夫象征所说的\n“比赛结果未必会一样”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1b675a6a2f7734387acad02b93b403b6bbcf3582285c20ac8eb37de78d3b541",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c4100048e645ca152d983c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了推翻鲁道夫象征的预测，\n东海帝王向目白麦昆\n提出了进行模拟赛的要求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28416a51fc02fe7ffd37dcdb6223a6e29181595c34f0fb527d1bfa454e7ed6b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e10f4014ac84477352a78e1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那场竞赛的结果──\n一如鲁道夫象征所言，\n以目白麦昆的胜利收场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e0b9e845c2bf42ca0e60bb27cc3b930fb39c6f3ee51f2e5153f050b86e1259",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c761a0e59f374971457ba7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不足之处",
      "source_fingerprint": "171735f903af8b7574ce3aca9ade653ac2c683159ac87610410e821495a2f1bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87e6d197bc3faab7e4edb492",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为提升实力而举办的“夏季集训”\n终于开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c79f665973ac823f7e21087b648603266983b9853de496057bce30a3efad1d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56de022a3e51ca7c03dd932f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了跟平常不同的环境，\n东海帝王掩不住兴奋的神情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dcc329eda444d81e3127cf1f0c6ba996a02c1f74c0ec8c049b14422f1773260",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01099a17d6c19f3a852756a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "注意着她的状况，避免她过于乱来……\n热血的夏季集训开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c156864dc7b0a4d2819a9e4ef30a6481ec95e39ede715bf96568b0d32152f78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a38e60e5b598b14f3568cef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab393101167afca610406fcd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "左右今后竞赛结果的重要活动──\n夏季集训的时期到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c857a9b384491f011cba8cd98b66b6ade8f0d0a58d96d06fb4f908fc8abd4b2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc68d61c3f4c0935eae6580",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王为了在“日本杯”赢得胜利，\n鼓足干劲认真进行训练──",
      "source_fingerprint": "57fb4707218c16c99ed6d07eb385e3c95f1d294b80128e27dca5a881bf662b11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b9198a771a60a784c8ac6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时隔一年，\n我与她的夏季集训就此开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97b5c271623164ab6c3a3379278f603d5f874bf9e4fb29f411443b4d7733c046",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf83c4584189da456f27415",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aec66094a4622fde2dedb88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王终于要迎向\n“出道战”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6054343a9f62f00efa2f506bf0fb76ee93a84a05d3544476c24505fb9576ec1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b0a328c344679fdc4054da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她斗志高昂地踏入赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ad196e72362b8538a94a8e25cba21ce311d818d98159e14fa93ac16fd3a7c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e88499be09480f999ca6a13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王的传说\n在此揭开序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b7106d885a0fc560b599489887fed5b9ca87230d33ef699b3aeff4ac14254a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31108915db8880c31c243d89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29035de5cfd38859a55a3bf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放眼经典赛而率先挑战的比赛，\n“若驹锦标”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f72bec537879e947d1b33b190e65cbdc318eecdf7fa91e33f87a7a154c831e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e7ef7ab57577c1ed433ea9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王丝毫不觉得紧张，\n反倒兴奋不已且干劲十足。为避免兴奋过度\n而搞砸比赛，她深吸了几口气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eecee4c29d3a4a20078bae9fae98544fa46e0c74812963046b2a8290d4e8f636",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
